        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "A. The terms and conditions of this Agreement shall be in full force effective at one minute past midnight on July 2, 2004 and terminating at 11:59 p.m. on September 30, 2007, unless the University and AFSCME mutually agree in writing to extend any or all of the terms and conditions of this Agreement. There shall be no re-opener negotiations for the duration of this Agreement.",
